---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import AssuranceMark from '../components/AssuranceMark.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — assurer.ai">

  <!-- Navigation (R1: inherits DEFAULT_LINKS) -->
  <SiteHeader />

  <main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="flex flex-1 flex-col focus:outline-none">
    <section data-reveal class="container-content py-16 sm:py-24">
      <!-- §3.7G anchor: the same quiet trust mark, small and top-left of the
           column (≥640 only; document pages keep a text-first hero) -->
      <div class="mb-6 hidden sm:block">
        <AssuranceMark class="h-[72px] w-[72px]" />
      </div>
      <p class="font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-accent">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-balance leading-tight text-[clamp(1.75rem,7.5vw,3rem)]">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-secondary">Last updated: August 2026</p>

      <div class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-3xl space-y-8 text-body">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">What We Collect<span class="heading-underline" aria-hidden="true"></span></h2>
          <p class="mt-2">When you use our keep-in-touch form, we collect:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-brand-accent" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span><strong>Email address</strong> — required, so we can send you updates.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-brand-accent" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span><strong>Name</strong> — optional, to personalise communications.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-brand-accent" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span><strong>Feedback message</strong> — optional, so you can tell us what you're interested in.</span></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-2">We do not collect any other personal data from browsing this website. We do not use tracking cookies, analytics pixels, or fingerprinting.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Where Your Data Is Stored<span class="heading-underline" aria-hidden="true"></span></h2>
          <p class="mt-2">Your form submission opens your email client, which sends your message directly to hello@assurer.ai. We do not store your personal data on any website server or third-party platform at this stage. Once our mailing list platform (Brevo) is configured, your data will be stored exclusively on Brevo servers in the European Union (Paris, France) under a Data Processing Agreement (DPA).</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Why We Process Your Data<span class="heading-underline" aria-hidden="true"></span></h2>
          <p class="mt-2">We process your data on the basis of your explicit consent (GDPR Article 6(1)(a)). You give consent by ticking the opt-in checkbox on our keep-in-touch form. We will use your data to:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-brand-accent" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span>Send you updates about our product progress, research findings, and early access opportunities.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-brand-accent" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span>Respond to your feedback and questions.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">How Long We Keep Your Data<span class="heading-underline" aria-hidden="true"></span></h2>
          <p class="mt-2">Emails you send through our form arrive at hello@assurer.ai and are subject to our standard email retention policy. You can request deletion of your data at any time. Once our mailing list platform is configured, you can unsubscribe at any time via the unsubscribe link in any email we send.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Your Rights<span class="heading-underline" aria-hidden="true"></span></h2>
          <p class="mt-2">Under GDPR, you have the right to:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-brand-accent" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span><strong>Access</strong> — request a copy of the personal data we hold about you.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-brand-accent" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span><strong>Rectification</strong> — request correction of inaccurate data.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-brand-accent" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span><strong>Erasure</strong> — request deletion of your data.</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-brand-accent" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span><strong>Unsubscribe</strong> — withdraw consent at any time via the unsubscribe link in any email we send, or by contacting us.</span></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-2">To exercise any of these rights, email us at <a href="mailto:hello@assurer.ai" class="text-brand-accent hover:underline">hello@assurer.ai</a>.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Data Processing Agreement<span class="heading-underline" aria-hidden="true"></span></h2>
          <p class="mt-2">Our current form uses your email client to send messages directly to hello@assurer.ai, so no third-party data processor is involved yet. Once we configure our mailing list platform (Brevo), we will process subscriber data through Brevo under a Data Processing Agreement. Brevo provides GDPR-compliant consent management, automated unsubscribe mechanisms, and data export/deletion tools. All subscriber data will remain within the European Union.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Contact<span class="heading-underline" aria-hidden="true"></span></h2>
          <p class="mt-2">If you have questions about this policy or how we handle your data, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@assurer.ai" class="text-brand-accent hover:underline">hello@assurer.ai</a>.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <!-- Footer (R2: inherits DEFAULT_SITEMAP, rich) -->
  <SiteFooter />

</BaseLayout>
